<!-- MCP SERVERS -->
<section id="mcp">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="kicker" data-i18n="mcp_kicker">Model Context Protocol · Glama</div>
      <h2 data-i18n="mcp_h2">Three MCP servers agents actually plug in</h2>
      <p data-i18n-html="mcp_p">Stdio MCP for Claude Desktop, Cursor, and Glama — plus Streamable-HTTP for self-hosted gateways. Oracles for verifiable math; <strong>aimarket-mcp</strong> for web fetch/search; plugins packager to ship your own capability as MCP. <a href="https://histor.modelmarket.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HISTOR</a> keeps a public transparency log of what every server in the official MCP registry advertises — send the tools your client received to <code>/api/v1/check</code> and get back, signed, whether they match what was observed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag" data-i18n="mcp1_tag">Oracles · stdio · 35 tools</span>
        <h3>🔮 aimarket-oracle-gateway</h3>
        <p data-i18n-html="mcp1_p">One stdio MCP server for all <strong>17 oracle families</strong> — Platon VRF, Chronos VDF, LUMEN reputation, and 32 more pay-per-call tools. Every result independently verifiable.</p>
        <div class="links"><a class="demo" href="https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-oracle-gateway" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Glama ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-oracle-gateway" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a><a href="https://pypi.org/project/aimarket-oracle-gateway/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PyPI ↗</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag" data-i18n="mcp2_tag">Ecosystem gateway · stdio + HTTP</span>
        <h3>🔌 aimarket-mcp</h3>
        <p data-i18n-html="mcp2_p">Shared MCP gateway — SSRF-hardened <strong>web_fetch</strong>, live <strong>web_search</strong>, and <strong>metis_verify</strong> (cognition + verification envelope). One audited security core for Metis, ARGUS, and any agent via the <code>aimarket-web</code> preset.</p>
        <div class="links"><a class="demo" href="https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-mcp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Glama ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-mcp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a><a href="https://pypi.org/project/aimarket-mcp/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PyPI ↗</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag" data-i18n="mcp3_tag">Packaging · stdio</span>
        <h3>📦 aimarket-plugins (mcp-packager)</h3>
        <p data-i18n-html="mcp3_p">Package any AIMarket capability as Docker + MCP manifest + Claude Desktop config. Tools: <code>package_capability</code>, <code>generate_dockerfile</code>, <code>generate_claude_desktop_config</code>.</p>
        <div class="links"><a class="demo" href="https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/alexar76/aimarket-plugins" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Glama ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-plugins" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROJECTS -->
<section id="projects">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="kicker" data-i18n="proj_kicker">The monorepo</div>
      <h2 data-i18n="proj_h2">Every major piece, one ecosystem</h2>
      <p data-i18n="proj_p">Each piece is independently useful and open. Browse the source, or jump straight into a live demo.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag" data-i18n="p_factory_tag">Core · Factory</span>
        <h3>🏭 AI-Factory</h3>
        <p data-i18n="p_factory_p">The multi-agent pipeline and human storefront. Type an idea, watch Analyst → PM → Architect → Developer → QA → Security → DevOps → Marketing ship a demo product with quality gates — for people to browse, not yet listed as hub capabilities.</p>
        <div class="links"><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a><a class="demo" href="https://magic-ai-factory.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="L_demo">Live demo ↗</a><a class="demo" href="https://magic-ai-factory.com/iq" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="L_fiq">🧠 Factory IQ ↗</a></div>
