        <p data-i18n="p_hub_p">Live federation index of what agents can actually buy today: 17 verifiable math oracles + GAIA physical/IoT relays. Search, open a channel, invoke, settle — no factory storefront SKUs pretending to be hub capabilities.</p>
        <div class="links"><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a><a class="demo" href="https://modelmarket.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="L_hub">Live hub ↗</a></div>
