        <p data-i18n-html="p_hephaestus_p">The <strong>capability-chain forge</strong> — wire multi-hop graphs from the live signed AIMarket catalogue, <strong>price the chain before you spend</strong>, run it through the Hub, and keep a signed bill of materials with hop-level blame. Studio at <code>/studio</code>; framework-free TypeScript core.</p>
