        <h3>🔮 Oracles</h3>
        <p data-i18n-html="p_oracles_p">Seventeen live mathematical oracles on shared <strong>oracle-core</strong> — signed randomness, VDF delay, consensus, reputation, optimization, sampling, time-lock puzzles, optimal transport, and graph spectra. Discoverable on the Hub; cosmic 3D visuals + 377 tests.</p>
