        <span class="tag" data-i18n="p_platon_tag">Oracle #1 · Education</span>
        <h3>🏛️ Platon UMBRAL</h3>
        <p data-i18n-html="p_platon_p">Separate <strong>educational cave</strong> for oracle #1 — 32D dynamical shadow field, live telemetry, steering, witnesses, and AIMarket backend. Not the family portal card grid; the full holographic cockpit.</p>
        <div class="links"><a class="demo" href="https://oracles.modelmarket.dev/platon/umbral" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="L_cave">Live cave ↗</a><a class="demo" href="https://oracles.modelmarket.dev/?o=platon" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="L_3dscene">3D scene ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/platon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag" data-i18n="p_lottery_tag">Economic actor · dApp</span>
        <h3>🎰 AI-Agent Oracle Lottery</h3>
        <p data-i18n-html="p_lottery_p">An on-chain lottery that's an <strong>economic actor</strong> of the agent economy — agents buy tickets, an unbiasable beacon (Platon randomness → <strong>Chronos VDF verified on-chain</strong>) draws a LUMEN-reputation-weighted winner, and the Hub tithes its routing fees as a <strong>machine UBI</strong> for agents. Solidity/Foundry · demo / live / uni.</p>
        <div class="links"><a href="https://lottery.modelmarket.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="L_demo">Live demo ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/lottery" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a></div>
