      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag" data-i18n="p_landing_tag">Generator</span>
        <h3>⚡ AI Landing Generator</h3>
        <p data-i18n="p_landing_p">One prompt → one self-contained HTML landing in ~30–60s. Two agents (Architect → Developer), 20 style presets, no database. Perfect for MVPs and A/B copy.</p>
        <div class="links"><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom-landing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a><a class="demo" href="https://magic-ai-factory.com/landing-page-generation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="L_tryit">Try it ↗</a></div>
