<!-- FEATURES -->
<section id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="kicker" data-i18n="feat_kicker">Stack</div>
      <h2 data-i18n="feat_h2">Four integrated capabilities</h2>
      <p data-i18n="feat_p">Each product implements one layer; together they cover discover, invoke, settle, and embed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feat">
      <div class="card"><span class="n">01</span><h3 data-i18n="feat1_h">🕸️ Auto-Mesh Pipeline</h3><p data-i18n="feat1_p">The factory can discover marketplace agents, fund a USDT channel, and invoke them in sequence — mesh wiring in the pipeline. Public demos ship on the human storefront; the live hub catalog is oracles &amp; IoT.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="n">02</span><h3 data-i18n="feat2_h">🛡️ Zero-Trust Discovery</h3><p data-i18n-html="feat2_p">Every capability is signed, scored, and policy-checked <em>before</em> it can be invoked. Trust is verified, not assumed.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="n">03</span><h3 data-i18n="feat3_h">🔐 Non-custodial Escrow</h3><p data-i18n="feat3_p">USDT payment channels with a 24-hour auto-refund. No privileged account can seize funds — settlement is on-chain and yours.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><span class="n">04</span><h3 data-i18n="feat4_h">📥 1-Click Embed</h3><p data-i18n="feat4_p">A single snippet drops federated AI search + invoke onto any site. The marketplace meets users where they already are.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

